      Thi Pham, Thu Vu, Huyen Nguyen Thi Thu, Lam Khanh Ho, Dung Nguyen Tien. 
      Originally published in JMIR Bioinformatics and Biotechnology 
      (https://bioinform.jmir.org), 07.05.2024.
